  "description": "Retrieval for RAG on top of EraTech.AI.Ingestion: IKnowledgeRetriever (vector, keyword or hybrid search fused with Reciprocal Rank Fusion, a real score threshold, optional reranker hook, neighbour/parent expansion, a cited context string with a token budget), Microsoft.Extensions.AI helpers (context messages, a search_knowledge_base AIFunction) and the IKnowledgeVectorStore contract that the store packages implement (tenant from ICurrentTenant inside the store, one partition per embedding model and dimension). No database driver.",
